    <div class="overlay-panel">
      <button class="overlay-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="overlay-content">
        <span class="overline">Empowering Movement</span>
        <h2>Reconnect with your body at your own pace.</h2>
        <p>These classes are designed with survivors in mind. No pressure, no performance. Just gentle movement to help you feel at home in your body again.</p>
        <h3 class="carousel-label">Empowering Series</h3>
        <div class="overlay-cards"><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Survivor Series</h4><p>Movement and mindfulness designed specifically for trauma survivors.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Multi-level</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Calm in the Chaos</h4><p>Find stillness even when everything around you feels uncertain.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Intermediate</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Busy Place Quiet Mind</h4><p>Grounding practices for when your environment feels overstimulating.</p><span class="wellness-tag">All levels</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Back to the Mat</h4><p>A gentle re-entry for those returning to movement after a long time away.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Beginner</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Inner Strength Series</h4><p>Build physical and emotional resilience through intentional practice.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Intermediate</span></a></div>
        <h3 class="carousel-label">Calm and Strong Kids</h3>
        <div class="overlay-cards"><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Kids Meditation</h4><p>Age-appropriate mindfulness to help children process big emotions safely.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Kids</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Kids Yoga</h4><p>Playful, body-positive movement for young ones who need a safe outlet.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Kids</span></a></div>
        <h3 class="carousel-label">Wellness Programs (Bursaries Available)</h3>
        <div class="overlay-cards"><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Mindful about Menopause</h4><p>Support for navigating hormonal changes with compassion and awareness.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Program</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Let Go of Anxiety</h4><p>Tools and practices for managing anxiety rooted in lived experience.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Program</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Vibrant: Inflammatory Lifestyle</h4><p>Holistic practices addressing the physical toll of chronic stress and trauma.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Program</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay-sleep" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-label="Sleep and meditation resources">
    <div class="overlay-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="overlay-panel">
      <button class="overlay-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="overlay-content">
        <span class="overline">Rest Your Mind</span>
        <h2>For the nights that won't quiet down.</h2>
        <p>Hypervigilance doesn't switch off just because you're safe now. These sessions are made for the 2am moments when your body is still scanning for danger.</p>
        <div class="overlay-cards"><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Yoga Nidra: Guided Meditation for Sleep</h4><p>A deep relaxation practice that guides you into restful sleep without forcing it.</p><span class="wellness-tag">All levels</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Yoga Class for Sleep</h4><p>Gentle, floor-based movement to release the tension your body holds onto at night.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Beginner</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Body Scan for Letting Go</h4><p>A guided meditation releasing tension you didn't know you were carrying.</p><span class="wellness-tag">All levels</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Rain Sounds with Gentle Guidance</h4><p>Soft spoken cues layered over rain sounds to ease you into rest.</p><span class="wellness-tag">Beginner</span></a><a href="#" class="overlay-card overlay-card-link"><h4>Safe Place Visualization</h4><p>Build an internal sense of safety your body can return to each night.</p><span class="wellness-tag">All levels</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

